   "caption": "Course LTI External tools: activate Minerva and show it in the activity chooser.",
   "context": "Step 1. Enable Minerva in your course\n\nCourse LTI External tools: activate Minerva and show it in the activity chooser.\n\nStep 1. Enable Minerva in your course\n\nMinerva is registered across Moodle, but it does not appear in a course until you switch it on. In your Moodle course, open the More menu and choose LTI External tools. Find Minerva, activate it, and turn on Show in activity chooser.\n\nCourse LTI External tools: activate Minerva and show it in the activity chooser.\n\nOnce enabled correctly, Minerva appears in the activity chooser with its logo. If you instead see a blank or generic icon, the tool was registered without its icon; contact lambda@dsv.su.se.\n\nStep 2. Add the Minerva activity to a section\n\nIn your Moodle course, turn on Edit mode, select Add an activity or resource in the section where you want the assistant, and choose Minerva.",
